| `mflux-warm` | int4-1216x704-s4 | 1216×704 | 4 | 1.05s | **63.86s** | 78.98s | 78.98s | 11.1 GB (mlx) | ext | 79.0 min | OVER |

## Verdicts

- **OVER** · `mflux-warm` / int4-1024x1024-s4 — 84.9 min for 60 shots; 3808712 swapouts observed at only 31% of RAM — attributed to other processes, timings may be noisy — exceeds the 60 min budget
- **OVER** · `mflux-warm` / int4-1216x704-s4 — 79.0 min for 60 shots; 3097610 swapouts observed at only 31% of RAM — attributed to other processes, timings may be noisy — exceeds the 60 min budget

## Recommendation

**Phase 0 exit criterion not met on this machine.**

2 configuration(s) swapped — those do not fit in unified memory. Try a smaller quantization or lower resolution.
Fastest viable configuration projects 79.0 min per 60-shot job. Per PLAN.md section 6 this is the trigger to decide on a rented GPU now rather than in Phase 3 — the worker is a stateless client, so relocating it is a deployment change.

